:: Temple Bailey Intro Vouch
<<effects>><<npc Bailey>><<person1>><<npc Jordan 2>>

<<person2>>Jordan looks at you with a worried expression. "Is everything okay, <<sister "Jordan">>?" <<he>> asks. "That is your guardian, correct?"
<br><br>

<<person1>>You step closer to Bailey. <<person2>>Jordan watches, <<his>> gentle expression unchanged.
<br><br>

<<if $speech_attitude is "meek">>
	"B-Bailey takes good care of us," you say. Your voice carries further than you intended. "I don't want anyone to worry."
<<elseif $speech_attitude is "bratty">>
	"Bailey looks after me," you say flatly. "Better than most would. We don't need anyone's concern."
<<else>>
	"My guardian has nothing to answer for," you say. "Bailey provides for us. That's more than most can say."
<</if>>
<br><br>

<<person1>>Bailey hasn't moved. <<He>> is looking directly at you with a warm smile that twitches on one side.
<br><br>

"I'll see you in a week," <<he>> says. Then <<he>> turns, strides down the centre aisle, and leaves the temple.<<npcincr Bailey dom 1>><<set $bailey_dom += 1>><<gdom "Bailey">><<npcincr Bailey love 1>><<set $bailey_love += 1>><<glove "Bailey">><<set $stockholm_points to ($stockholm_points || {})>><<if !$stockholm_points.temple>><<set $stockholm_bailey to ($stockholm_bailey || 0) + 1>><<set $stockholm_points.temple to true>><<gbaileystock>><</if>>
<br><br>

<<link [[Next|Temple]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
